  "bio": {
    "eyebrow": "About Dr Ibrahim",
    "heading_lead": "Meet",
    "heading_warm": "Dr Ibrahim.",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Dr David Ibrahim (MED0002438943) is dedicated to compassionate patient care. He holds a Bachelor of Medical Science from Griffith University and a Doctor of Medicine from Sydney University. His interests include; chronic disease management, aged care, men's health, sporting injuries, and medication reviews.",
      "Outside of work, he prioritises family time, especially with his wife and newborn son, volunteering at my local parish, and staying active through soccer and bike-riding."
    ]
